build ido menu items from the menu model ourselves

ubuntu's patched gtk3 turned model items carrying x-canonical-type into ido
widgets from inside the menu tracker. we don't ship that patch, so walk the
model after gtk_menu_shell_bind_model and swap the plain items gtk built for
the ones ido's factory makes, the way libayatana-indicator does.

